span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">학년도 전기</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(2016</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">년 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">2</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">월</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">) </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">신규 졸업유예 신청자부터 졸업유예 최대학기는 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">4</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">개 학기에서 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">2</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">개학기로 변경됨 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양중고딕\">※ </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕\">재신청자는 기존대로 최대학기 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">4</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕\">개 학기로 유지</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: -33.2pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">나</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">졸업유예 등록금을 납부 완료하여야 졸업유예 신청이 완료</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: -34.7pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">다</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">등록금 인상에 따른 차액</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">인상분</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">) </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">발생 시 추가로 등록금을 납부 완료하여야 </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">졸업유예신청 완료</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">2015. 12.</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 17pt; text-shadow: auto; mso-fareast-font-family: HY헤드라인M\">교 무 처 장</span></p>\n\t\